         MACRO ,
&LABEL   $RETREG &REG=,&VALUE=
.*
.*       Some later-era CMS functions return values in other than R15.
.*       CMSCALL knows how to do that, but little (or nothing?) in
.*       VM/370 does.  We do it this way...
.*
&LABEL   L     R15,CURRSAVE   Find SVC savearea that called us.
         ST    &VALUE(1),EGP&REG-SSAVE(,R15)  Pass value back.
         MEND  ,
